  "independent_findings": [
    "One object-owned exact-time village setup/veto then finite attempted hostile wave. Complete135-line VillageSiege,61-line cancellable event and19-line time interface actually read; supporting counters, nested samples, variants and failure paths are not individual references.",
    "Native startup/chunk dispatch and native-admission support are exactly covered by own prior Cat/Allay reads,12bound ranges reused0. Overworld custom list differs from natural SpawnState loop; doMobSpawning/debug/dimension/flags constrain entry. Current pack category caps, actual scheduling and admitted actors are not certified.",
    "Own tick guards !isDay and hostile flag; friendly flag unused. Else DONE and hasSetup=false only. Count/delay/coordinates remain; disabled host calls can freeze own state. Level369..375 fixed-time/isDay body read, no entire world/light/host model claim.",
    "Float timeOfDay at exact double0.5 causes nextInt10 reroll before DONE/setup checks. FullLevelTimeAccess and DimensionType95..101 map dayTime through fixed-or-day normalized cosine curve, interpolation argument unused. No once-night latch: repeated delivered same-time calls can reroll even prior active state; no guarantee current clock visits equality. CAN_ACTIVATE enum is unused here.",
    "players() returns actual list; ordered first nonspectator currently village and not excluded biome is selected, no own isAlive check. Village section-distance/occupiedVILLAGE POI semantics reused from actual prior Cat study, not HOME quota. One raw mushroom_fields tag read from exact archive; loaded effective biome tag not established.",
    "At most10ring anchors32 from playerXZ/currentY; each helper at most10 random offsets[-8,7] with WORLD_SURFACE height, village and Monster.EVENT tests. These are bounded potentially repeated samples, not100distinct sites/wholeplayers/terrain readiness/guaranteed setup.",
    "Monster81..107 and Mob827..842 actually read: nonPeaceful,sky RNG,dimension block-light threshold, thunder/raw-brightness sampler, below-block valid spawn because EVENT!=SPAWNER. Own helper never instance-checks full body/bbox/liquid/above/worldborder; light/chunk/provider/event internals unexpanded. No reliable collision safety, cap bypass or actual encounter.",
    "Valid probe posts cancelable VillageSiegeEvent with siege/level/player/attemptedVec3. Cancellation returnsfalse before quota/delay, leaves hasSetupfalse/TONIGHT under normal tick return; no durable stop-the-night latch despite event Javadoc. Externally reentrant/modifying handlers unexpanded. Probe is not final actor destination or native-add receipt.",
    "Setup initializes nextSpawnTime0 and quota20 only on valid noncancelled probe. Critically first eligible player returns true even all10anchor probes fail: tick sets hasSetuptrue, fresh zero quota may finish and return1 with no spawn; reused fields can retain leftover count/delay while coordinates were replaced. No next-player search then. Source implication only, not reproduced bug.",
    "Positive delay decrements and returns0; zero/nonpositive resets2, attempts only if remaining>0 then debits after normal void helper return; else setsDONE but still returns1. Two positive-delay delivered calls then a zero call between opportunities, not guaranteed walltime. Twenty initializes primary attempt budget, not20successful actors or total-actor upper bound.",
    "Each trySpawn resamples near stored anchor, not earlier event probe. Null location normalreturn, nullable create dereference/finalization inside Exception catch normalreturn, so outerdebit still occurs. move/add outside catch; not all throws swallowed/debited. No atomic wave entitlement or success-coupled commit.",
    "ZOMBIE registration286 is concrete Zombie::new MONSTER0.6x1.95. Nullable feature-gated factory support reused0. Own actual constructor88..105 only bounded partial surrounding behavior. Caller passes getCurrentDifficultyAt(zombie.blockPosition()) and EVENT BEFORE intendedVec3 move. No constructor/full inherited graph/current behavior or observed origin exploit certified.",
    "Full Zombie.finalizeSpawn421..471 delegates super first, uses supplied local multiplier, creates optional baby/Jockey group, equipment/enchants/holiday and attributes. Actual421..501 plus538..547 read; Forge baby/reinforcement config getters are dependencies, actual config values unproved. Baby path may selectexistingChicken or create/move/finalizeJOCKEY/flag/request ride/add before outer move; add/ride results ignored. Secondary requests make primary20 not totalactors guarantee. Chicken/attributes/ride/light/runtime remain bounded.",
    "Zombie then moveTo candidate and void addFreshEntityWithPassengers. Reused verified ServerLevel855..867 and persistentmanager61..106/134..142 support removed/cancelledJoin/UUID-rejection boundaries; own normal-return counters ignore admission. No strict birth/kill/loot/itemUUID/playerdamage/payment/worldsave proof.",
    "Complete source has no own read/save/NBT or durable pending receipt. Object reconstruction, skipped clocks, repeatedexacttime, cancelretry, stalequota and terminal1 remain explicit. No native reproduction/performance, allworldchance or savedwave acceptance.",
    "Whole-policy differences: EA1weather-clocked bounded beached encounter has no finite village setup veto/debited wave; EA2seedhabitat persisted giveup no delivered hostile quota; EA3/EA7table/predicate injection no direct object wave; EA9worldgen persistenthome cohort no clock/event cancellation; EA11trader-attached rider expiry no standalone wave. Cat occupiedHOME/local-density replenishment has no exact-time finitehostile budget. Shared clocks/helpers/ignoredadmission are0. Prior actual MainCat complete-decision reads reused, not old source chains reread."
  ],
